# One stopword (literal string or extended regex) per line.
# Copy this file to .stopwords.local and fill in names of outside
# projects/teams/hackathons/clients that must never appear in this repo.
# .stopwords.local is gitignored (see .gitignore: *.local) — never commit it.
#
# Example:
# some-other-product
# SomeHackathonName
